###Mapping
Mapping test::indigoprairie4::mapping::PrairieBaseMapping
(
  *test::indigoprairie4::domain::CollectionProvenance[provenanceSet]: Pure
  {
    ~src test::indigoprairie4::source::RawCollectionRecord
    collectionCode: $src.collectionCode->trim()->toUpper(),
    regionName: $src.regionName->trim(),
    primaryAlias: $src.aliases->first()->toOne()->trim()
  }
)
